**Finding: Compliant** (NOSOLICIT — Non-solicitation of employees binding Customer)

The agreement contains no non-solicitation, no-hire, or anti-poaching covenant. Keyword sweeps for "solicit", "recruit", "induce", "hire", "employ", and "personnel" surfaced only:

- **p0066** — independent-contractor / no-employment-relationship boilerplate;
- **p0061** — confidentiality permitting internal disclosure to employees and directors on a need-to-know basis;
- **p0051 / p0052** — mutual indemnities referencing third parties "hired by, employed, retained or under" a Party's control;
- **p0035 / p0045** — data-security limits on which authorized personnel may access databases.

None of these restrains AP from soliciting or employing Kubient personnel, and the survival provision (p0070) lists no restrictive covenant. This sits at our **preferred** position — no non-solicit on the Customer — so no redline was proposed.
